{"id":"a27c6e4aaf7a32c7","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-minimum-operator.md","title":"Minimum Operator","display":"df-minimum-operator — Minimum Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-minimum-operator","aliases":["57-df-minimum-operator"],"display":"df-minimum-operator — Minimum Operator","depends_on":["[[57-df-recursive-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-minimum-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-minimum-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-minimum-operator — Minimum Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Minimum-Operator\">Minimum Operator</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为总函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n\\)</span>。递归性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cca93ccf127333f\" href=\"?note=3cca93ccf127333f\" title=\"57-df-recursive-function\">57-df-recursive-function</a>；以下定义本身只用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的全定义性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu g\">\\(\\mu g\\)</span> 是部分函数图；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)\">\\(\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)\">\\(\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)\\)</span> 为其点值接口，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)\">\\(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)\\)</span> 时有值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mu g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\ng(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\ (g(\\vec x,z)\\ne0)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&amp;=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ (g(\\vec x,y)=0)\\},\\\\\n\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&amp;\\longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)\\coloneqq(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\n=\\min\\{y\\in\\mathbb N:g(\\vec x,y)=0\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mu g&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\ng(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z&lt;y\\ (g(\\vec x,z)\\ne0)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&amp;=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ (g(\\vec x,y)=0)\\},\\\\\n\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&amp;\\longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)\\coloneqq(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\n=\\min\\{y\\in\\mathbb N:g(\\vec x,y)=0\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>无见证时没有函数值；该必要规则不再只放在 Remark。此处的输入 g 为总函数，不冒充允许中间计算发散的另一种广义最小化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Minimum-Operator","text":"Minimum Operator","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"3cca93ccf127333f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$g:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N$ 为总函数；$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n$。递归性见 [[57-df-recursive-function]]；以下定义本身只用 $g$ 的全定义性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu g","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mu g&\\coloneqq\\{\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^n\\times\\mathbb N:\ng(\\vec x,y)=0\\land\\forall z<y\\ (g(\\vec x,z)\\ne0)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&=\\{\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^n:\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ (g(\\vec x,y)=0)\\},\\\\\n\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)&\\longrightarrow\n\\bigl(\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)\\coloneqq(\\mu g)(\\vec x)\n=\\min\\{y\\in\\mathbb N:g(\\vec x,y)=0\\}\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mu y\\,(g(\\vec x,y)=0)&\\coloneqq\\mu y\\,g(\\vec x,y)\n\\quad(\\vec x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mu g)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1345,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algeb